OL,3,GNEWSABlur drummer gives pupils insight
OL,4,Ainto photography
OL,5,
OL,6,FBlur drummer Dave Rowntree gave primary
OL,7,Fschool children an insight into his
OL,8,Flove of photography when his
OL,9,Fphotography exhibition was held in
OL,10,FBrighton.
OL,12,FRowntree taught the children about
OL,13,Ftraditional methods of photography and
OL,14,Fhow to develop pictures.
OL,16,FHe started taking photographs at the
OL,17,Fstart of the band's career as he
OL,18,Fbelieved Blur wouldn't be that
OL,19,Fsuccessful and he wanted to document
OL,20,Ftheir journey.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
