OL,3,GNEWSABlur drummer gives pupils insight
OL,4,Ainto photography
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne child, who had been hearing from
OL,7,FRowntree on how to take and develop
OL,8,Fimages, said: "It's really cool" but it
OL,9,F"takes longer" than expected to see the
OL,10,Ffinished product.
